  "exact_argument": "The two residuals change from (5,4) to (6,3), preserving mass9 and increasing squared spread by4. Strict concavity of x^p for0<p<1 gives 6^p+3^p<5^p+4^p. The local paid bill is unchanged; both complete-profile moments strictly increase in kappa and bracket their roots in(0,1). Thus this literal fill raises the supplier-profile root relative to pinned PR2853.",
